<!-- PAGE 8: TOR SUMMARY -->
<h1 style="font-size: 18pt;">INTERNSHIP INTRODUCTION & TOR SUMMARY</h1>
<p class="center italic" style="color: #475569;">Keep this section concise: one page only.</p>

<table>
    <tr><td class="bg-label">Host Organization & Sector</td><td><b>MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic</b> (Healthcare & Diagnostic Services Sector)</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="bg-label">Department / Unit</td><td>Ultrasound Diagnostic & Medical Informatics Unit</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="bg-label">Internship Role</td><td>Full-Stack Software Engineering Intern</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="bg-label">Duration</td><td>7 Weeks / 280 Working Hours (15 July, 2026 to 02 September, 2026)</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="bg-label">Site Supervisor</td><td>Clinical In-Charge</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="bg-label">Faculty Supervisor</td><td>[Insert Faculty Supervisor Name]</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Organization & Internship Introduction</h3>
<p>MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic is a dedicated healthcare facility in Islamabad offering general outpatient medical consultations, maternal-fetal care, and specialized diagnostic ultrasound services. The clinic operates active ultrasound examination units providing abdominal, pelvic, KUB, and obstetric radiological scans. During my 7-week internship from 15 July to 02 September 2026, I served as a Full-Stack Software Engineering Intern tasked with designing, developing, and deploying a customized Clinical Ultrasound Reporting & Patient Management Web Application. The software directly digitizes and automates the clinic's daily ultrasound diagnostic pipeline, allowing clinical staff to input findings with automated organ-wise structuring, generate verifiable PDF reports directly formatted for MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic's official letterhead, embed verification QR codes, and manage patient billing.</p>

<h3>Internship Objectives</h3>
<ol>
    <li>Design and develop a custom clinical reporting platform for MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic using Node.js, Express, TypeScript, and PostgreSQL.</li>
    <li>Standardize clinical reporting for 6 core ultrasound study types (Whole Abdomen, Upper Abdomen, KUB, Pelvic Ultrasound, Obstetric Ultrasound, and Obstetric TVS).</li>
    <li>Implement a live Organ-Wise Findings Engine with one-click 'Set All Normal' presets to accelerate report writing for clinic doctors.</li>
    <li>Build an automated PDF generation engine formatted precisely for MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic's official letterhead with verification QR codes.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Scope of Work / TOR</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Frontend</b>: Custom diagnostic examination forms, real-time finding sync engines, responsive UI layout, one-click normal presets, and instant report previews.</li>
    <li><b>Backend</b>: Express API endpoints, PostgreSQL relational database schema for patient records and ultrasound reports, session-based authentication (bcryptjs), and regex parsing.</li>
    <li><b>Reporting & Verification</b>: High-resolution PDF document creation with coordinate alignment for MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic's official letterhead, signature blocks, and verification QR code embedding.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Professional Conduct</h3>
<p>I confirm strict adherence to patient privacy, clinical confidentiality, medical data security ethics, punctuality, and university academic integrity throughout my internship at MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic.</p>

