<h3>Weekly Reflection & Evidence</h3>
<p><b>Key achievement / skill developed:</b><br>
Successfully deployed the digital QR verification engine onto MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic's diagnostic report letterhead and streamlined the 6 core clinical ultrasound examination templates with instant automated routing.</p>

<p><b>Challenge faced and solution:</b><br>
<b>Challenge:</b> Embedding dynamic QR code buffers onto MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic's specific letterhead without overlapping with pre-printed clinic details or multi-page medical text.<br>
<b>Solution:</b> Calculated dynamic footer height offsets in pdf-lib and rendered the QR code in a dedicated bottom-right accreditation zone with strict bounding dimensions.</p>

<p><b>Evidence attached/referenced (e.g., screenshot, commit, document, meeting note):</b><br>
• Sample diagnostic ultrasound PDF report branded for MAAN JEE Memorial Clinic with embedded verification QR code.<br>
• Git commit log: 'feat: add clinic verification QR code and streamline 6 core study modules'.<br>
• Live verification scan result on smartphone confirming authentic patient diagnostic details.</p>
